{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S06、S13等段落的感受信息过密，虽然有时点控制，仍容易让观众顾着追逐细节，削弱对整体叙事的连续把握。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词建立了清楚的视觉入口，短句交替感受词也让观众能先抓住人物此刻的处境，再通过按音乐时点出现的细节理解情绪变化。更重要的是，Y把舍不得亲近、害怕再次受气、无法忍受孤单、不愿因此回头之间的心理因果交代得更细，前后转变也更有层次。X的连续叙述确实更顺畅，但右侧短词与左侧叙事的对应关系不够明确，音乐感受也相对概括，少了一些具体而细腻的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c2a4ca0-38a9-401f-adbe-c5190c6d03a8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T214502611528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:45:45.114841+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eed70bbce0b71f28d2edb4fe544a70e3ed7f33e01d7011ef63b2bc0d9d8080d7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g